+# API Specialist Gate Final Audit: APPROVED for KANBA-109 (KB-P2-12)
+
+- Reviewer: arch-reviewer (Swarm Systems/Backend Architect & API Specialist Gate)
+- Worktree: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-109`
